  "description": {
    "en": "The Yonex VCORE 100L Ruby Red 2026 offers the signature VCORE spin in a lightweight 280 g package. With a 100 sq.in head and 16x19 string pattern, it provides easy racquet acceleration, generous power and excellent comfort for improving intermediate players.",

